{"id": "1547078162645524521", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "1389806015561728032", "author_name": "topcat.0001_40485", "content": "Mmm they’re not going to admit that they are abandoning it.\n\nPlacing it on “maintenance mode” until they have the manpower/ability to balance things  is just gacha code for soft EOS.\n\nIf you’ve been here a while you know they havnt been afraid to make drastic changes to Traphase before. (Typically catastrophic) The shift is just them lying through their teeth.", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T02:56:17.297000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "Agrippa_wronged", "emoji_id": "1468257746058088562", "count": 1}]}
