{"id": "1547125392530481193", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "606977530913751059", "author_name": "togepirsona", "content": "as someone playing Glotan after boycotting glotan. Someone here said “just play glotan if you’re complaining about losing to glotan.” I really took it to heart.\nMy biggest fears in matches are Agrippa, Erica, Tulu.", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:03:57.779000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:04:13.887000+00:00"}
