{"id": "1547126607678804131", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "606977530913751059", "author_name": "togepirsona", "content": "It be like that. I changed my name to GLotan cheats and play GLotan.\n\nIf you don’t let her sit on cards, you’re somewhat winning. Paralysis, the discard/draw posse - ultra one with a top hat (is it happy magic show?) can be somewhat effective I think. Run paralysis though.", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:08:47.493000+00:00", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:09:05.717000+00:00"}
{"id": "1547127472502345810", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "514145255923253272", "author_name": "milliampere_0237", "content": "Personally, you kill her before she could kill you.\n\nThere's multiple ways to achieve this and I kinda always do it:\n- MANDATORYISH: usually they save up their 3cost for ult. So I have that gate of truth(?) (I forgot, it's the gate) where you can get 2 of their highest arith cards. They usually seem to have that.\n- have 1 char that applies weakness (could just be pollux...) and one that stuns (like aigis) so u can stun their tinct/doll/casiah as you do your stuff\n\nNot mandatory, pick your poison\n- If those teams have no debuffers, pollux can crush her to death (depending on luck)\n- vortice + deepsea and if you're lucky enough to get 5costs + deepsea at turn 1 or near that, you're gonna do wonderfully (unless they have clementine but they usually do not)\n- pickman also helps with this stuff. I once literally nuked an entire team w/ him (extra thanks to glotan 3cost)\n- your typical helot + gmurph can also work if you could speedrun it", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:12:13.683000+00:00", "type": 19, "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-09T06:13:41.627000+00:00", "mentions": ["1314503145635975188"], "reply_to": "1547125101948960928"}
